       "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "<i>Ve Day Celebrations in London, England, UK, 8 May 1945</i><br>\nA young man holds aloft a large Union Flag amongst the huge crowd of people that has gathered in Whitehall to listen to Churchill's Victory speech and to celebrate Victory in Europe Day.  The crowd is a mix of service personnel, civilians and children.  To the left of the photograph, the back of a bus, also packed with people, is just visible.",
